AB  - Cyber-attacks targeting systems are intensifying yearly, and the shortage of security personnel is becoming serious. Therefore, a fundamental review of security operations based on automation using artificial intelligence (AI) is required. In today’s information society, it is difficult to maintain people’s autonomous decision-making due to misinformation and disinformation, and the object of security is expanding from systems to human cognition. In this article, we introduce innovative cybersecurity operations using generative AI and cognitive security that supports autonomous human decision-making. © 2025, Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp. All rights reserved.
