AB  - This paper presents an architecture for an autonomous Tier 1 security analyst designed to operate across heterogeneous SOC environments. Unlike static automation, the proposed framework utilizes a schema-agnostic abstraction layer to normalize diverse security logs into a unified investigation context. The system employs a Solver-Critic cognitive loop, where distinct agents propose and verify investigation traces against raw evidence to mitigate hallucination. This enables the autonomous triage of high-volume alerts without hardcoded integrations.  © 2026 IEEE.
